## 📁 **Project Structure**

### **Type System** (`src/types/`)
```
types/
├── core/                    # Base interfaces (IEntity, ITechBaseEntity, etc.)
│   ├── IEntity.ts           # Base entity with id, name, description
│   ├── ITechBaseEntity.ts   # Adds techBase, rulesLevel
│   ├── ITemporalEntity.ts   # Adds introductionYear, extinctionYear
│   └── ComponentInterfaces.ts
├── enums/                   # Core enumerations
│   ├── TechBase.ts          # INNER_SPHERE, CLAN, BOTH
│   ├── RulesLevel.ts        # INTRODUCTORY, STANDARD, ADVANCED, etc.
│   ├── Era.ts               # AGE_OF_WAR through DARK_AGE
│   └── WeightClass.ts       # LIGHT, MEDIUM, HEAVY, ASSAULT
├── construction/            # Construction system types
│   ├── EngineType.ts        # Engine definitions
│   ├── GyroType.ts          # Gyro definitions
│   ├── ArmorType.ts         # Armor types and allocation
│   └── HeatSinkType.ts      # Heat sink definitions
├── equipment/               # Equipment definitions
│   ├── weapons/             # Weapon categories
│   │   ├── EnergyWeapons.ts
│   │   ├── BallisticWeapons.ts
│   │   └── MissileWeapons.ts
│   ├── AmmunitionTypes.ts
│   ├── ElectronicsTypes.ts
│   ├── MiscEquipmentTypes.ts
│   ├── PhysicalWeaponTypes.ts
│   └── VariableEquipment.ts # Variable property calculations
└── unit/                    # Unit-level types
    ├── BattleMechInterfaces.ts
    └── DatabaseSchema.ts
```

### **Utilities** (`src/utils/`)
```
utils/
├── construction/            # Construction calculations
│   ├── engineCalculations.ts
│   ├── gyroCalculations.ts
│   ├── armorCalculations.ts
│   ├── movementCalculations.ts
│   └── heatSinkCalculations.ts
├── equipment/               # Equipment calculations
│   ├── EquipmentCalculator.ts     # Unified entry point
│   └── variableEquipmentCalculations.ts
├── physical/                # Physical property utils
│   ├── weightUtils.ts       # ceilToHalfTon, etc.
│   └── criticalSlotUtils.ts
├── temporal/                # Era/availability utils
│   └── availabilityUtils.ts
└── validation/              # Validation utilities
    └── rules/
```

### **Services** (`src/services/`)
```
services/
├── catalog/                 # Unit catalog management
├── equipment/               # Equipment data access
└── integration/             # Service orchestration
```

